# ==========================================================================
# GovEase — Member 2 (Government News & Updates)
#
# Everything ignored here is either generated at runtime or local to one
# machine. All source, frontend, seed data and documentation stays tracked.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Python bytecode / caches ---------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# --- SQLite database ------------------------------------------------------
# Created on first run by backend/database/db.py init_db(). Committing it
# would put a binary in the repo that every clone immediately rewrites.
# Recreate with: python -m news.collector --seed
backend/database/govease.db
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Environment / secrets ------------------------------------------------
# The project uses no secrets today (every os.environ value is a numeric
# tuning knob or a port). Listed so a future key can never be committed
# by accident. An .env.example, if one is ever added, stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Virtual environments -------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.python-version

# --- Editor / IDE ---------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS clutter -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Packaging / test artifacts -------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Logs -----------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
